# The Moonlit Path (battlefield.moonlit_path): the requirement arms. Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted but
# no Moon Bauble: MS_Entrance: the key item check fails: no options. bob, with the bauble but the quest only available:
# fails.
lists FullMoonFountain/MS_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.3,9.5,-260.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.3,9.5,-260.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath accepted
bob: keyitem MoonBauble
login
trigger MS_Entrance                     # no bauble: no options
bob: login
bob: trigger MS_Entrance                # available: no options
